msgid ""
"B<startx> [ [ I<client> ] I<options> \\&.\\|.\\|. ] [ B<-\\^-> [ I<server> ] "
"[ I<display> ] I<options> \\&.\\|.\\|. ]"
msgstr ""
"B<startx> [ [ I<client> ] I<options> \\&.\\|.\\|. ] [ B<-\\^-> "
"[ I<serveur> ] [ I<display> ] I<options> \\&.\\|.\\|. ]"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
